  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\mathrm{M_o}$ is the mass of an oxygen isotope $\\mathrm{{ }_8 O^{17}, M_p}$ and $\\mathrm{M_N}$ are the masses of a proton and a neutron respectively, the nuclear binding energy of the isotope is",
